'''WibuScript''' is an [[esoteric programming language]] and multi-dialect JavaScript transpiler created in 2026 by [[Muhammad Rafli]] (Rafli161102). Designed to bridge Japanese anime tropes, otaku culture, and Indonesian internet meme culture into modern software development, WibuScript translates stylized pseudo-Japanese and Indonesian internet slang into standard, high-performance ECMAScript.

